LAMMPS (15 Sep 2022)
# Find minimum energy fcc configuration
# Mark Tschopp, 2010

# ---------- Initialize Simulation ---------------------
clear
units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
atom_modify map array
variable a equal 5.0

# ---------- Create Atoms ---------------------

lattice         fcc $a
lattice         fcc 5
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5 5 5
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      2 box
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20 20 20)
  2 by 1 by 3 MPI processor grid
create_atoms    1 box
Created 256 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20 20 20)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds
lattice         fcc $a origin 0.50000000 0.50000000 0.50000000
lattice         fcc 5 origin 0.50000000 0.50000000 0.50000000
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 5 5 5
create_atoms    2 box
Created 256 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (20 20 20)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.001 seconds

mass 1 180.9479  # Atomic mass of Ta
mass 2 12.011    # Atomic mass of C


# ---------- Define Interatomic Potential ---------------------
pair_style hybrid/overlay zbl 4.0 4.2 snap
pair_coeff 1 1 zbl 73 73
pair_coeff 1 2 zbl 73 6
pair_coeff 2 2 zbl 6 6
pair_coeff * * snap ../TaC_pot.snapcoeff ../TaC_pot.snapparam Ta C
SNAP Element = Ta, Radius 2.86954, Weight 1
SNAP Element = C, Radius 2, Weight 0.9293160905266721
SNAP keyword rcutfac 1.0
SNAP keyword twojmax 6
SNAP keyword rfac0 0.99363
SNAP keyword rmin0 0.0
SNAP keyword bzeroflag 1
SNAP keyword wselfallflag 1
SNAP keyword chemflag 1
SNAP keyword bnormflag 1
SNAP keyword switchinnerflag 0
SNAP keyword quadraticflag 0

# ---------- Define Settings ---------------------
compute eng all pe/atom
compute eatoms all reduce sum c_eng
thermo 10

# ---------- Run Minimization ---------------------
reset_timestep 0
fix 1 all box/relax iso 0.0 vmax .001
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step pe lx ly lz press pxx pyy pzz c_eatoms
min_style cg
minimize 0 1e-8 50000 100000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 7.73908
  ghost atom cutoff = 7.73908
  binsize = 3.86954, bins = 6 6 6
  2 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 2 0 0
  (1) pair zbl, perpetual, half/full trim from (2)
      attributes: half, newton on, cut 6.2
      pair build: halffull/newton/trim
      stencil: none
      bin: none
  (2) pair snap, perpetual
      attributes: full, newton on
      pair build: full/bin/atomonly
      stencil: full/bin/3d
      bin: standard
Per MPI rank memory allocation (min/avg/max) = 5.813 | 5.896 | 5.942 Mbytes
   Step         PotEng           Lx             Ly             Lz           Press           Pxx            Pyy            Pzz          c_eatoms   
